        "summary": {
            "type": "html",
            "content": "<p><b>Mount Fuji</b><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"> </span> is an active stratovolcano located on the Japanese island of Honshu, with a summit elevation of 3,776.24 m. It is the highest mountain in Japan, the second-highest volcano on any Asian island, and the seventh-highest peak of an island on Earth. Mount Fuji last erupted from 1707 to 1708.</p>"
